[I] A standard input word picker

[T] smenu is a command-line tool that reads words from standard input,
[T] presents them in a terminal menu and outputs the words selected by the
[T] user, making it useful for building interactive selections in shell
[T] scripts.

[U] https://github.com/p-gen/smenu

[A] Smenu Authors
